# Finance Ratio Analyzer

A simple corporate finance web application that calculates and explains five key financial ratios.

## Features

- Net Profit Margin
- Return on Assets (ROA)
- Return on Equity (ROE)
- Debt-to-Equity Ratio
- Current Ratio
- Demo financial data
- Simple ratio interpretations
- Claude-powered financial explanation

## Technology

- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
- Claude API
- Vercel

## Purpose

This application helps users quickly understand basic financial performance, profitability, leverage, and liquidity using financial data provided by the user.

## Financial Ratios

### Net Profit Margin
Net Profit / Revenue × 100

### ROA
Net Profit / Total Assets × 100

### ROE
Net Profit / Total Equity × 100

### Debt-to-Equity
Total Debt / Total Equity

### Current Ratio
Current Assets / Current Liabilities

## Disclaimer

This application is for educational and analytical purposes only. It does not provide investment advice.